fore the fire, against a contractual interval of six months. Matter referred to the recovery team.\n\n## Outstanding Actions\n\n1. **Business interruption settlement** – Await conclusion of forensic accountant's review and agreed final quantum\n2. **Recovery against maintenance contractor** – Follow up position with recovery team\n3. **Final adjuster settlement** – Agree material damage settlement with loss adjuster once all elements resolved\n\n---\n*Prepared by claims handler; Large loss unit handling*\n"}, "result_hash": "sha256:befbc0a32836da44aaccfd995cca4b995eb9fc852baae6976d1458db44e7df08", "result_bytes": 88, "permission_decision": "allowed", "egress_target": null, "context_document_ids": ["claim:TM-2026-0061", "casefile:TM-2026-0061/file-note.md"]}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
